ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.","Fluidni heroj iz DOTA2 koji zapoveda uzburkanim talasima, slobodno preliva Snagu i Okretnost, jača kroz Plimu i oseku i poprima oblik neprijatelja."
ClassDescription,"A masked DOTA2 blademaster who builds unstoppable momentum through Bladeform, carves through magic with Blade Fury, sustains allies with Healing Ward, and cuts down foes with Blade Dance and Omnislash.","Maskirani majstor sečiva iz DOTA2 koji gradi nezaustavljiv zamah kroz Oblik sečiva, seče kroz magiju Besom sečiva, leči saveznike Totemom isceljenja i obara neprijatelje Plesom sečiva i Omnislashom."
ClassDescription,"A relentless DOTA2 crimson berserker who thrives alone with One Man Army, taunts entire rooms with Berserker's Call, carves attackers with Pure Counter Helix spins, and executes the weak with Culling Blade.",
